# AIW runtime-generated artifacts — never part of a branch's
# real changes. Nothing in here is hand-authored: project config lives in
# the tracked `aiw.json` at the repo root, so this ignore has no
# exceptions and needs no `git add -f`.
.aiw/
tui.json
# Upstream AMF's equivalents (old checkouts and worktrees shared with AMF).
.amf/

# .claude/ runtime files are also ignored via .claude/.gitignore; listed
# here too so fresh checkouts/worktrees ignore them before that file exists.
.claude/review-notes.md
.claude/review-notes-archive.md
.claude/final-review-feedback.md
.claude/final-review-progress.json
.claude/final-review-snapshot.json
